  "eyebrow": "Morning Brief",
  "headline": "Flash PMI 58.4, 5y auction tailed 3.1bp, Oct 28 hike odds 71%, 10y highest since 2007",
  "stance": "The bond market repriced on strong data and a poor 5y auction. Rates set the terms for everything else today.",
  "news": [
    {
      "head": "Flash composite PMI 58.4, highest since July 2021",
      "body": "Reported Wednesday, up from 56.0 in August. Input costs rose at the fastest rate since October 2022, on fuel and freight."
    },
    {
      "head": "$70bn 5-year auction tailed 3.1bp",
      "body": "Wednesday's sale drew 2.21 cover, the weakest since December 2018. Dealers took 15.8%. Indirect bidders took 54.3%."
    },
    {
      "head": "Barr says more hikes are likely needed",
      "body": "The Fed governor said Wednesday that further policy adjustments are likely. Futures now price 71% for the October 28 meeting."
    },
    {
      "head": "Collins sees inflation staying above target",
      "body": "The Boston Fed president said Wednesday there is an increased likelihood inflation stays notably above 2%."
    }
  ],
  "implications": [
    "The 5-year note cleared at 5.033% Wednesday, the highest since June 2006. Equities compete with cash again.",
    "Rate vol is back and equity vol is not. The next equity drawdown starts in the bond market."
  ],
  "watch": [
    {
      "head": "Jobless claims, 8:30",
      "body": "The first labor read since the PMI. A high claims number is the only thing today that slows the repricing."
    },
    {
      "head": "$44bn 7-year auction, 1:00",
      "body": "The first demand test after Wednesday's tail. Watch the dealer takedown, not the headline yield."
    },
    {
      "head": "New home sales, 10:00",
      "body": "The first housing read at these yields. Mortgages price off the 10y, and it moved 15bp Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "head": "Fed balance sheet, 4:30",
      "body": "Reserves and the Treasury account into the September 30 quarter turn. Reverse repo has no buffer left."
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Macro & Rates",
      "bullets": [
        "The 10y rose 15bp Wednesday, its biggest one-day move since November 2024.",
        "Real yields carried it. The 10y real rate is the highest since November 2008, with breakevens up 2bp.",
        "Every tenor moved together. The 2y, 10y, 20y and 30y each rose 11bp or more Wednesday."
      ],
      "positioning": "September 15 report: specs sit at the 100th percentile long 5-year Treasury, up 13 points on the week. That is the note that just tailed.",
